    "title": "Have a conversation with MySQL at PyCon Hong Kong 2021 - PyCon HK",
    "description": "MySQL is the world's most popular OS database. With its proven performance, reliability and ease-of-use, MySQL has become the leading database choice for web-based applications, used by high profile web properties including Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, Yahoo! and many more. Additionally, it is an extremely popular choice as embedded database, distributed by over 3,000 ISVs &",
