    "visibleText": "Staff Team – PyCon Hong Kong 2021 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Staff Team – PyCon Hong Kong 2021 Posted on September 1, 2021 September 26, 2021 Putting together a 2 days conference is not an easy task. Our thanks to each and every one of them for making this conference possible. Conference Chair: Sammy Fung. Sales: Calvin Tsang. Website and Social Media: Daisy Maris Fung. Chief Designer: Claire Wong. Finance: Haggen So. Marketing: Fiona Lam. Program: Sammy Fung. Proposal Vetting Committee: Albert Au Yeung, Arnold Chan, Gavin Chan, Payton Chan, Chris Choy, Claire Chung, Pili Hu, Scotty Kwok, Kirill Pavlov, Andrew Svetlov, James Ing Wei Tang. Operation: Sam Chiu, Henry Law. Education Track: Alan Chow, Vivian Fung. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← PyCon HK 2021 Live Conferencing ← Ticket – PyCon Hong Kong 2021"
