    "visibleText": "Ticket – PyCon Hong Kong 2021 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Ticket – PyCon Hong Kong 2021 Posted on September 1, 2021 September 27, 2021 Tickets are on sale now. Multiple promotional offers are available from just Free admission to a HK$200-400 Sponsor ticket that includes a T-shirt and other goodies. Ticket Type Price Sales End Offers Corporate Ticket HK$400 9 Oct The corporate ticket holders can get a T-shirt and access to live zoom conferencing. An invoice will be provided. A part of the ticket amount will be donated to Python Software Foundation. We offer discounts for groups of five or more people. For group purchase, please email pycon@pycon.hk Individual Ticket HK$200 26 Sep 11:30pm The individual ticket holders can get a T-shirt and access to live zoom conferencing. The remaining amount of ticket revenue will be donated to Python Software Foundation after deducting the related cost of the T-shirt. No official invoice & receipt is provided. Student Ticket HK$100 9 Oct Only full-time student is eligible to Student Ticket. The student ticket holders can get a T-shirt and access to live zoom conferencing. No official invoice & receipt is provided. Free Ticket supported by Financial Aid Program Free 9 Oct Everybody Pay is the PyCon’s tradition and policy. The Financial Aid Program is available and provides free tickets to the attendee who has their personal concerns to afford the ticket cost. Individual Ticket (Late Bird) HK$300 Sales start on 27 Sep 2021 The individual ticket holders can get a T-shirt and access to live zoom conferencing. The remaining amount of ticket revenue will be donated to Python Software Foundation after deducting the related cost of the T-shirt. No official invoice & receipt is provided. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Staff Team – PyCon Hong Kong 2021 ← Have a conversation with PCCW-HKT at PyCon Hong Kong 2021"
