    "description": "Being able to predict cooling load, the rate of heat removed from the indoor space, is crucial to achieve thermal comfort and high energy performance of central air-conditioning (AC) systems in buildings. In this talk, we first demonstrate feature engineering from time series data using Pandas package. With the extracted features, we develop our ML",
