    "title": "From Zero to Hero, My Python journey to the West - PyCon HK",
    "description": "I left Hong Kong, the place that I was born and lived for 30 years, 5 years ago with no technical experience. (Except for a few programming experience in University time, mainly serves my research studies) Moving to London, a city where technology is in high demand, opens a lot of doors for me. Here",
