    "title": "Intelligent pricing for an e-commerce platform - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Identifying the right price for the right customer at the right time has always been an utmost challenge to many e-commerce players. Powered by big data and customer personalization, the Club@HKT is able to apply intelligent pricing to improve customer experience and increase sales conversion rate. Speaker: Mr. Alex Zhang, Mr. Ben Wong / PCCW-HKT",
