    "title": "PyCon HK 2021 calls for proposals - PyCon HK",
    "description": "PyCon HK 2021 will be organised virtually on 8-9 October and it is now calling for proposals. PyCon HK 2021 will have English, Cantonese, and Education tracks this year.CFP Submission: https://forms.gle/roP6WDYGYK61eKX16CFP Deadline: 14 June 2021 (Extend!) (We accepts late submissions till the end of June.)Proposal Vetting Period: June 2021Conference Date: 8-9 October 2021The PyCon Hong",
