    "visibleText": "PyCon HK 2021 calls for proposals - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK PyCon HK 2021 calls for proposals Posted on May 10, 2021 June 20, 2021 PyCon HK 2021 will be organised virtually on 8-9 October and it is now calling for proposals. PyCon HK 2021 will have English, Cantonese, and Education tracks this year. CFP Submission: https://forms.gle/roP6WDYGYK61eKX16 CFP Deadline: 14 June 2021 (Extend!) (We accepts late submissions till the end of June.) Proposal Vetting Period: June 2021 Conference Date: 8-9 October 2021 The PyCon Hong Kong starts in 2015. This event becomes one of the catalysts in promoting and driving the proliferation of Python development and usage in the city. The PyCon HK looks for speakers through the Call for Proposals process and Sponsorship Packages from the city and overseas. It consists of English and Cantonese tracks – 2 main languages of citizens in this international city. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← PyCon HK 2021 will be back in October ← Guide your children into the realm of AI with coding"
