    "visibleText": "PyCon Hong Kong 2021 Conference is coming again this Oct! - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK PyCon Hong Kong 2021 Conference is coming again this Oct! Posted on September 15, 2021 October 6, 2021 “Data Science Upholds the World” Data scientists are taking a leading role in applying advanced analytics tools and techniques in ways that can help people in need. The field plays an increasingly important role in all aspects of modern life. Like people in other professions, data scientists feel a duty to contribute their skills and knowledge to serve people in their communities and around the world. We are pleased to invite you to attend the PyCon Hong Kong 2021 sessions on Oct 8-9. This event is a gathering of hundreds of “inquisitive, innovative, collaborative” developers and data scientists like you who share a common interest in promoting Python and leveraging data science practical solutions for sustainable development. We’ve received over 30 proposals with brilliant ideas from speakers around the world. They will be put into 17 sessions across keynote and 2-tracks breakout sessions over the 2-days programme. It is a great opportunity to learn first-hand information about Python Community and connect with like-minded developers and data scientists to expand your professional network. Date: Oct 8-9, 2021 (Fri-Sat) Time: 10:30am – 5:00pm (Oct 8), 10:30am – 6:00pm (Oct 9) Agenda: https://pycon.hk/2021/2021-schedule/ Tickets are o n sale now. Multiple promotional offers are available from just Free admission to a HK$200-400 Sponsor ticket that includes a T-shirt and other goodies. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Privacy Policy Statement 2021 ← PyCon Hong Kong 2021 Conference is coming in 2 weeks!"
