    "title": "Python Versions and Dependencies Made Easy - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Managing Python versions and dependencies can be painful. JavaScript developers have their \"node_modules\" folders, but we don't have \"python_modules\" (yet!) in Python. Instead, we have those mysterious virtual environments. And if you also want to switch between different Python versions, it can quickly turn into a mess. It doesn't have to be that way. With",
