    "description": "Under COVID, \"genome\" is no longer an alien word to us. Yet, there is many miles more to go to truly understand the genome as a whole set of heriditary materials, even for academic biologists. A genome sequence assembly is a collection of DNA sequences, which serves as a fundamental resource of any genetic studies,",
