    "title": "Using PySide2 and Qt Quick as GUI for IoT Project on Raspberry Pi - PyCon HK",
    "description": "It is more fun to have a GUI to play with sensors than using a command line! In this session, we will discuss how to use Python to communicate with sensors on Raspberry Pi, and hence display on a GUI built with PySide2 and Qt Quick. Speaker: Mr. Arnold Chan / Hong Kong - GitHub,",
